WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.860
"Class, please be quiet."

2
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:13.060
"Let's start the quiz."

3
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.920
"There are five questions."

4
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.540
"Is this a quilt?"

5
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.860
"Yes, it is. It is a quilt."

6
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.780
"Is the boy quick?"

7
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:34.480
"Yes, he is. He is quick."

8
00:00:36.013 --> 00:00:37.936
"Do ducks quack?"

9
00:00:38.423 --> 00:00:43.408
"Yes, they do. Ducks quack."

10
00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.090
"Is the woman a queen?"

11
00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:52.150
"Yes, she is. She is a queen."

12
00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.750
"Is this a quarter?"

13
00:00:56.170 --> 00:01:00.190
"Yes, it is. It is a quarter."

14
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.680
"Good job! You finished the quiz!"

15
00:01:09.207 --> 00:01:30.480
quick
